WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.023 --> 00:00:03.422
Wukong soared through the air on a cloud.

2
00:00:03.423 --> 00:00:06.589
"I'll help this kingdom for a little while," he said.

3
00:00:06.590 --> 00:00:10.797
"Then I'll locate Bajie and return to Master."

4
00:00:10.798 --> 00:00:15.826
When Wukong arrived at True Savings Bank, he saw several people in blue uniforms.

5
00:00:15.827 --> 00:00:20.815
He also spotted Detective Smith.

6
00:00:20.816 --> 00:00:24.597
"Hello, again, Detective," Wukong said, landing next to him.

7
00:00:24.598 --> 00:00:29.081
"I'm here to help. Who's robbing True Savings Bank—demons?"

8
00:00:29.082 --> 00:00:31.127
Detective Smith rolled his eyes.

9
00:00:31.128 --> 00:00:36.126
"Very funny, Wukong. The robbers aren't demons."

10
00:00:36.127 --> 00:00:40.739
Wukong frowned. "I wasn't making a joke, but okay."

11
00:00:40.740 --> 00:00:45.877
He pulled out his iron bar. "I'll go inside and smash the robbers."

12
00:00:45.878 --> 00:00:49.179
Detective Smith gasped. "What did you say?"

13
00:00:49.180 --> 00:00:55.471
"I'm going to smash the robbers," Wukong said, swinging his iron bar.

14
00:00:55.472 --> 00:01:00.954
"I'll completely flatten them, and they'll never cause trouble again."

15
00:01:00.955 --> 00:01:05.245
"No, Wukong!" Detective Smith said, holding up his hands.

16
00:01:05.246 --> 00:01:10.092
"We just need to arrest the robbers—it's wrong to hurt people."

17
00:01:10.093 --> 00:01:14.008
"You're right," Wukong said with a sigh.

18
00:01:14.009 --> 00:01:18.993
"Everyone is always telling me the same thing—it's not okay to hurt anyone.

19
00:01:18.994 --> 00:01:24.253
Don't worry, Detective, I promise to be good."

20
00:01:24.254 --> 00:01:28.690
Wukong put away his iron bar and went inside the bank.

21
00:01:28.691 --> 00:01:32.225
Two men were stuffing stacks of small green paper into bags.

22
00:01:32.226 --> 00:01:37.611
One man saw Wukong and laughed. "Check out the monkey, Earl!"

23
00:01:37.612 --> 00:01:43.742
Earl laughed. "I see him, Dwight! He's one funny-looking monkey!"

24
00:01:43.743 --> 00:01:46.603
"Where did he come from?" Dwight asked.

25
00:01:46.604 --> 00:01:48.517
Wukong tapped his chin.

26
00:01:48.518 --> 00:01:52.890
"I originally came from a rock, on the Fruit and Flower Mountain."

27
00:01:52.891 --> 00:01:55.850
"The monkey talked!" Earl said.

28
00:01:55.851 --> 00:02:01.884
"Yes, I can talk," Wukong said with a laugh. "And

29
00:02:01.885 --> 00:02:05.153
I'm here to inform you that you're both under arrest." For

30
00:02:05.154 --> 00:02:12.458
a moment Dwight and Earl were silent, and then they burst out laughing. Wukong

31
00:02:12.459 --> 00:02:16.196
pretended to laugh for a second before growing tall. His

32
00:02:16.197 --> 00:02:19.676
eyes turned red. "Ahh!"

33
00:02:19.677 --> 00:02:27.028
The men screamed and ran out of the bank. "Freeze!"

34
00:02:27.029 --> 00:02:29.851
a police officer shouted. Dwight

35
00:02:29.852 --> 00:02:35.285
and Earl ignored the police as they dived into a car and took off. Smash!

36
00:02:35.286 --> 00:02:39.820
Wukong leaped through the bank's window and landed in the street. He

37
00:02:39.821 --> 00:02:42.638
saw the robbers' car disappear around the corner. Wukong

38
00:02:42.639 --> 00:02:44.442
had an idea. He

39
00:02:44.443 --> 00:02:48.966
quickly muttered a spell, and light sparkled before he changed form. He

40
00:02:48.967 --> 00:02:51.608
had transformed into a car! Vroom!

41
00:02:51.609 --> 00:02:55.987
Wukong's tires spun and smoke filled the air. He

42
00:02:55.988 --> 00:02:58.613
shot forward, zooming down the street. Wukong

43
00:02:58.614 --> 00:03:07.396
chuckled with delight. "This is fun!" ***

44
00:03:07.397 --> 00:03:11.505
"That juggler is very talented," Roxy said.

45
00:03:11.506 --> 00:03:14.648
She and the squire were eating a meal inside a beautiful room.

46
00:03:14.649 --> 00:03:19.140
A man juggled balls while several musicians played instruments.

47
00:03:19.141 --> 00:03:23.293
"Tell me about your powers," the squire said.

48
00:03:23.294 --> 00:03:27.999
Roxy shrugged. "I can fly and I have heat vision."

49
00:03:28.000 --> 00:03:33.495
"Fascinating," the squire said. "I'll be right back."

50
00:03:33.496 --> 00:03:36.299
He stood up and went into the kitchen.

51
00:03:36.300 --> 00:03:39.960
"I have to get back home," Roxy thought anxiously.

52
00:03:39.961 --> 00:03:43.392
She was enjoying her stay but felt worried about Wukong.

53
00:03:43.393 --> 00:03:47.703
"I hope the monkey isn't causing too much damage to Metro City."

54
00:03:47.704 --> 00:03:52.140
Suddenly her superhearing picked up a sound from somewhere else in the house.

55
00:03:52.141 --> 00:04:00.640
Roxy listened carefully. "Oh no," she thought. "Someone's crying!"

